(defconst WOKIE WOOKIEES)
(defconst WOKIES WOOKIEES)


; ============================================================================
; LEGACY GOAL GRAVEYARD
; ============================================================================
; relics from a simpler time, with the original dev comments preserved here!
; not every one is here since I did axe a whole lot of them over the period of developing C
; take a look in Computer Classic if you want to see the original GB script in its glory
; (and why it was easier to rewrite the thing from scratch, they did NOT write legible code)

	;(defconst boat-strategy 1)
	; Z: goal 1 is ACTUALLY used for resigning. I guess the goal did double purpose, which does technically work but I would highly not reccomend
	;(defconst boats-needed 2) ;goal 2 0 okay on boats; 2 1 need warships! 2 2 we've won with ships
	;(defconst military-parity 3) ;Goal  3 0 = military parity; Goal  3 1 = an enemy outnumbers us!
	;(defconst attack-control 4) ;goal  4 = used to track attack group AI
